<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">3YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWA IKADATU LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">3YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWA IKADATU LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili lwa ikadatu lwa Yohana lwandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Yohana mmilao ya 90 songela kuvumbuka kwa Kilisto. Yohana haitambule mwenyego kamba heyo iyo yandike ulupwilili, ila koikema heyo m'vyele (1:1). Kotenda kamba viyatendile mulupwilili lwa Yohana wa ikabili (2Yoh. 1:1). Yokoneka kamba Yohana kandika Usenga Unogile wa Yohana na zimhwilili ndatu za 1Yohana, 2Yohana, na 3Yohana kipigiti viyakalile yokala Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kamwandikila lupwilili luno munhu yamtogole Kilisto yokemigwa Gayo. Kamtambula Gayo kamba mbwigaake na kumulongela yawe mwende ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto awo wobita kubitila muisi yookala heyo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yohana kolutambuza lupwilili lwake (<char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:1">1:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Yohana komgangamiza Gayo na kumulongela kamba yawe mwende ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:2-8">1:2-8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho kowalonga wanhu wabili wayagwe, Diotilefe na Demetilio (<char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:9-12">1:9-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Hakimambukizo, komambukizila lupwilili lwake (<char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:13-14">1:13-14</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Yohana, m'vyele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">m'vyele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mkulu mdidale da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:1">Nomwandikila Gayo, mbwigaangu inimnogele kwelikweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2"/>Mbwigaangu, nokutambikila giladi uwe na ugima mulukuli na mbuli zose zigendelele vinogile kumwako, hata na loho yako igendelele vinogile. <verse eid="3JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3"/>Nideng'ha ng'hani ahaja wanhu wamtogole Kilisto viwezile na kunongela vija vuulibule uzenzeleganye muikweli na vija vuugendelela kutembela muikweli. <verse eid="3JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4"/>Haduhu kinhu kinideng'heza ng'hani kubanza kino, kuhulika kamba wanangu wotembela muikweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gayo Kotogoligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5"/>Mbwigaangu, gweye kwabule uzenzeleganye mmbuli zose zuuwatendela wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, hata kamba hewo wahenza kumwako. <verse eid="3JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6"/>Wasimulila noge jako haulongozi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, motenda vinogile ng'hani kamba muhawasangila giladi wagendelele na mwanza wao mnzila imnogele Mulungu. <verse eid="3JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7"/>Kwavija wasonga mwanza wao sama ya twaga da Kilisto na hawatogole kubokela msango wowose kulawa ha Wamhazi. <verse eid="3JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8"/>Avo tolondigwa kuwataza wanhu kamba wano giladi tuilumbe hamoja msang'hano yao ya kuipeta kweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Diotilefe na Demetilio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9"/>Niwandikila wanhu wamtogole Kilisto mbuli ino, ila Diotilefe, ayo yanogelagwa kuitenda kilangizi, hautogole udaho utulinao. <verse eid="3JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10"/>Avo niheza nowalongela gaja goyotenda, vija voyokweneza mbuli za uvwizi yotulonga tweye. Sio higo tu, ila vivija kolema kuwabokela wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na hata kuwagomesa waja walonda kuwabokela na kuwawinga walawe mumting'hano wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.<verse eid="3JN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11"/>Mbwigaangu, sambiwige gehile ila wige gaja ganogile. Munhu yoyose yotenda ganogile kalawa ha Mulungu, na munhu yoyose yotenda gehile hamonile Mulungu.<verse eid="3JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12"/>Kila munhu komulonga vinogile Demetilio, na kweli yenyego vivo imulonga, na tweye vivija tolava usindila sama yake, na gweye kuvitanga kamba usindila wetu kweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndamsa za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13"/>Nnago bwando ga kuwandikileni, ila silonda kuwandikileni na wino na peni. <verse eid="3JN 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14"/>Kipigiti kidodo hamwande notamanila kuiting'hana namwe tulongelele kihanga kwa kihanga.<verse eid="3JN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15"/>Tindiwalo dikale namwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Wambwiga zako wose wokulamsa. Walamse wambwiga zetu wose, mkuwatambula matwaga.<verse eid="3JN 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1"/>
</usx>
